      "message": "That would mean changing __all__ the HVCs that are using the allocator and that\u0027s few of them now :-\\\n\nHow about I just modify the ENOMEM from the vm_table into EBUSY?\n\nAlso, Mostafa suggested we could in the future actually use the hyp_alloc for that vm_table",
